{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西堂藏，百丈海，南泉願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道吾云：「滿也。」雲岩云：「湛\n湛地。」洞山云：「甚麼劫中曾欠少？」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0003001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0003001", "type": "orig", "text": "礙疑蹤"}
{"id": null, "n": "0004001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0004001", "type": "orig", "text": "老或作潦"}
